      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 853028343,
          "type": null,
          "body": "We use ccache+Ninja for most of our GitLab CI jobs, and so far we haven't run into any issues as far as I know. I *have* run into issues locally, usually after major API changes. This probably warrants discussion (or at least a heads-up) on -dev.",
